{"id":"troe","lemma":"трое","pos":"num","rank":935,"glosses":["three (in a group together), three of them"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Как вы трое познакомились?","en":"How did the three of you meet?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to meet","l":"познакомиться"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, чего вы трое хотите.","en":"I know what the three of you want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what for? why?"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Почему трое?","en":"Why are there three?","words":[{"g":"why"},null]},{"text":"Где ещё трое?","en":"Where are the other three?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"still / more"},null]},{"text":"Те трое были перед нами.","en":"Those three were ahead of us.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"in front of, before"},{"g":"we","l":"мы"}]}]}